ed the image of the ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.0828  Tc 1.8828  Tw (person who loved the Lord so much that he gave Him all he) Tj259.2 0  TD -0.0859  Tc 1.5368  Tw ( possessed. His sin was in his image. He was not ) Tj-259.2 -11.52  TD -0.0587  Tc -0.0613  Tw (concerned what God would think about him but what people would. That is what \223image\224 is all about. ) Tj408 0  TD 0  Tc -0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-372 -11.52  TD -0.0781  Tc 1.5981  Tw (Peter recognizes this deceit as an attack of Satan upon the church. ) Tj283.2 0  TD /F2 10.08  Tf0.0659  Tc 1.0621  Tw (The Jamieson, Fausset, and Brown ) Tj-319.2 -11.52  TD -0.0524  Tc 0  Tw (Commen) Tj36 0  TD 0.0203  Tc (tary) Tj16.32 0  TD /F0 10.08  Tf-0.0713  Tc 0.204  Tw ( penetratingly observes that Peter\222s question: \223How is it that Satan has so filled your heart that you have ) Tj-52.32 -11.52  TD -0.075  Tc 0.291  Tw (lied to the Holy Spirit?\224 implies \223that Satan is powerless over the hearts of men until they give him encouragement.\224 ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.0315  Tc 1.3515  Tw (We seldom recognize that b) Tj115.68 0  TD -0.059  Tc 1.079  Tw (ehind every effort to build an image for ourselves there is the strong influence of the ) Tj-115.68 -11.04  TD -0.0868  Tc 1.254  Tw (devil who wants to destroy the image of God in us. Ananias certainly did not live up to his name, which means: ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.1295  Tc 2.6228  Tw (\223The grace of God\224; neither did Sapphira, whose name mean) Tj262.56 0  TD -0.1039  Tc 2.3839  Tw (s \223beautiful.\224 Ananias and Sapphira are classical) Tj0  Tc -0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-262.56 -11.52  TD -0.1028  Tc 0.4628  Tw (examples of what Jesus calls \223the weeds\224 in the Parable of the Wheat and the Weeds.) Tj342.72 4.32  TD /F0 6.72  Tf0  Tc 0  Tw (171) Tj10.08 -4.32  TD /F0 10.08  Tf-0.0858  Tc 0.1716  Tw ( The weeds look like the real ) Tj-352.8 -11.52  TD -0.1058  Tc -0.0142  Tw (thing but their fruit is an empty hull. Ananias and Sapphira projected an image of piety, bu) Tj356.16 0  TD -0.1329  Tc 0.0129  Tw (t they were hypocrites. ) Tj91.2 0  TD 0  Tc -0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-411.36 -11.52  TD -0.0838  Tc 1.4543  Tw (Was this couple Christian? We cannot say for sure, but I believe they were. One cannot lie to the Holy) Tj0  Tc -0.6  Tw ( ) Tj-36 -11.52  TD -0.063  Tc 0.8375  Tw (Spirit if the Spirit is not in one\222s heart. Being filled with the Holy Spirit does not automatically mean the death of ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.0032  Tc 0.3632  Tw (\223self.\224 T) Tj34.08 0  TD -0.0579  Tc 0.235  Tw (he recognition to be crucified with Christ is usually a long and slow process. The grain of wheat that falls in ) Tj-34.08 -11.52  TD -0.0468  Tc 0.3195  Tw (the ground does not die overnight to produce fruit. We must be aware of the fact that we, ourselves, are our greatest ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.0419  Tc 0.8819  Tw (enemies. It is not without) Tj104.64 0  TD -0.0769  Tc 0.7569  Tw ( reason that it is said that God\222s greatest enemy is not Satan but the Christian. Unless we ) Tj-104.64 -11.52  TD -0.0901  Tc 0.4753  Tw (constantly and sincerely consecrate ourselves to the Lord, and daily present our bodies as a living sacrifice, the devil ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.0013  Tc -0.1187  Tw (will outsmart us without much difficulty. ) Tj167.52 0  TD 0  Tc -0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-131.52 -11.52  TD -0.1023  Tc 1.1682  Tw (The punishment of Ananias and Sapphira seems rather harsh to us. We must understand, however, that it ) Tj-36 -11.52  TD -0.092  Tc 1.412  Tw (was not Peter or the apostles who condemned the couple to death. Ananias\222 death may have been a spontaneous ) Tj0 -11.52  TD -0.042  Tc 0.402  Tw (reaction to the realization of the severity of) Tj174.72 0  TD -0.0903  Tc 0.1943  Tw ( his sin of omission. Whether the same was the case with Sapphira, we do ) Tj-174.72 -11.52  TD -0.045  Tc -0.075  Tw (not know.  ) Tj44.64 0  TD 0  Tc -0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-8.64 -11.52  TD -0.0924  Tc 1.0453  Tw (Luke comments: \223Great fear seized the wh